editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md-27-- **The category outdraws the brackets.** Crowds are turned away from a demonstration. The steward's report is verbatim ("no rule against"). Log: "The strata keep holding me up. Karis says she'll get to why when the season's over." [B4-reconciled 2026-10-05: "in the winter" dropped; not a §10 line.] This is a Book 8 plant and must stay at this altitude.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md-28-- **First in the region.** Withrow, who travelled to this meet only, says eight words: "Now we go be measured by everyone at once." The table session: Gault's qualifying-year story and his fourth place ("I have been mispriced by professionals, young man."); Ephram's toast "To the paper."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md-29-- **The academy celebration:** the waystation circular in a woodwork frame, and *eighteen years. counted anyway.* Lira on the crooked frame.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md-30-- **Vastin cutaway (~2,500):** the season summary and the appended query from an office that has not queried him in eleven years, verbatim: *mitigation options*, *containment framing*, *exposure trajectory*. He answers each as an evaluation and gets "acknowledged and not engaged." The next morning, with no requirement on his grade, he orders the Norhold observation files to his own desk and does not explain it to himself.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md:31:- **Havel cutaway (~800):** assigned to Norhold, second seat of six. He packs the private note between the manuals and notices that he has changed his pattern.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md-32-- **New episode — the cold term at Halcenvane (~8,000–9,000)** [B4-reconciled 2026-10-05: "winter" replaced throughout this packet; snow, ice and the melt are weather and stay]: the Norhold block. Rooke reorganizes for "a bracket of ceilings." Lira and Cael build a Zerin from meet times alone and cannot find a gather. Brom pins Marek's notations where he can see them and works the left-side door until it is the strongest in the house. Rooke makes Ephram the trial caller (captain-in-the-making). **Cael trains against the Shield reserve's renewal rhythm** and is pleased with himself. Karis builds "Norhold from its provinces" and **does not open the stratum note**; show her deciding, again, that the season comes first. The watchers stand in snow, two and two on the bell. A letter from Hesk in the cold months (not a birthday letter). **Seln's null report for the block (~800, cutaway).** The Norhold travel roster posts. Lira does not sleep on the night she reads the semifinal line she expects.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/packets/MOVEMENT-004.md-33-- **Departure.** The melt (weather, no season named) and the bluff road; Ostrand turns out at the bridge. End the movement at the gate or at the first waystation.
