editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-19-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-20-Two Compact men, two files, opposite directions. The companions *see* what Seln has become without a word of confession. Then Lira is caught up with, and the year is closed in its own ledger. Turns and promises:
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-21-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md:22:- **Departure.** Withrow and counsel ("A triumph." / "you dislike adjectives"). **Rooke to Brom:** "Your cohort standing holds. So, apparently, does your friend's paperwork. Noted." Brom explains it: "He adjusted, and he made sure somebody heard him do it." **Ilsev on the records-hall steps** (Cael's POV; keep her distinction exactly): the text "is simply on your side, which is worth an enormous amount and is not the same as being loved by anybody." **Havel (cutaway):** seals checked against the list, and he does not look up. For eleven days Cael has filed that as something without a name.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-23-- **Seln (cutaway, Ch58):** the compiled file back on the twenty-fourth, **unmarked**: "one of three. probably the third." The quarterly's five parts. The four closing lines (protected), "Continuation of embedded coverage recommended" carrying the whole weight. The reason is never written anywhere, including his cipher. The slip, "shaped to be burned," was the nearest thing to a conversation they ever had. The case, the bed pushed to the wall. "What he kept, he kept."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-24-- **The corridor, the twenty-seventh.** He stops, which he has never done. "Miss Karis." Records retention, the archive sweep on the tenth, east-range carrels as shared space, named upper rooms as not. "Researchers sometimes prefer to avoid it." Four trips with a borrowed hand-cart; Bracken grants a named room in ninety seconds without asking why. (This pays off M2's institutional-work-product plant.)
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-25-- **The council.** Karis gives it verbatim. "He named the range." "He knew where the notebooks were since the third week of term." Cael at the window: "Tonight he told us." / "He didn't tell us anything." "Omission is free… Tonight he performed an *act*." The slip is never mentioned aloud; Karis never mentions it either. **"Gratitude is the leak."** Nothing changes; "thank you for the form," every week. **Karis's finding against herself:** "I was applying a correct principle to the wrong class of object. He isn't an instrument." "Noted." / "Say it properly." / "That's what the page is for."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/packets/MOVEMENT-009.md-26-- **The unit's last session.** Six enrollees; pick a room and describe where its attention goes; Cael's sheet deliberately a fifth below best; "harder and less interesting, which is the correct order." Gwen (pending) is oblivious and kind. The pillar in the covered walk. "Second entry. Same file. Same nothing."
--
