editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/manuscript/chapter-26.md:11:Cael came up on a Third-day afternoon in the fifth week with two mugs of tea, because she had not been down to the common room since breakfast. He found her standing in front of the map with a pin in her mouth.
