editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md-17-*First period. Post held; cover unremarked by colleagues; calendar, floor ledger and wing correspondence within reach daily, as intended.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md-18-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md:19:*Subject's routine is disciplined and unremarkable. Trains under supervision on the four allocated days, east hall timber and north hall stone, signed for by whichever instructor the office names; has not been seen on any floor outside those hours. Keeps the lecture pattern of an ordinary enrollee. Sits in the public tiers at every practice afternoon of the Crown yard, his associates' bouts and strangers' alike. Extensive private notation habit; two books, written in daily, the larger left in his room on training days. No undisclosed capability observed.*
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md-20-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md-21-Every line was so. He had gone through it three times, looking for a single word that said more than his eyes had seen, and found none, and that was the whole of the art.
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md-22-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-18.md-23-He had been taught the art in his third year by somebody else's ruin. A colleague of his, older, careful, kind to juniors, had once written that a man at a ferry crossing was *uneasy*. One word, set down honestly about a man who had very likely only been cold. The word went up the line and came back a grade sharper, and went up again and came back sharper still, and by the time it reached a desk that could sign a warrant it had grown teeth. Then the warrant came down to the man who had written the word, and he was required to act on his own small guess as though it were somebody else's certainty. He acted. The man at the crossing had been cold. The colleague did not see out the year in the service. Seln had watched three others walk into the same mill since, each sure he was only helping.
