editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-24.md-191-*Best place. Again,* thought Cael. *Whatever a Bronze-tier Shadow Path is for, he's the finest hand at it I've ever stood near, and the craft is being nowhere. Ten weeks within a stone's throw of me, and I've seen him put a foot wrong once, on a morning I built for it.*
