editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-46.md:109:"A Force third-year and a Stone fourth-year. For the fifth line."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-46.md-110-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-46.md:111:"Fifth line." Brom considered the boards. "That's next year's seeding."
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-46.md-112-
editions/monroe-1.3/book-04-copper-crown/manuscript/chapter-46.md:113:"That's next year's seeding."
