editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/manuscript/chapter-58.md-45-It was not office stock; he knew office stock as he knew his own boots. He saw her fold it twice and put it inside her coat, and pick up her office pen again. He did not look for the words. He did not need to. He had four sheets of his own like it, carried through three postings and now in his kit between the second and third of his manuals, where nobody ever looked.
