editions/monroe-1.3/book-05-the-silver-standard/manuscript/chapter-58.md:47:That night, in his narrow room at the inn behind the east tower, he wrote a fifth. At its head he put the line from the return, which he had read upside down on her desk in perhaps three seconds and found he had entire.
